+# Corpus fetching
+
+The corpus fetch respected a per-domain limit of **12 visits per 60-second
+window**. After a breach, that domain entered a **900-second (15-minute)
+cooldown**.
+
+Files were fetched through these hosts:
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com`
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net` (using `/gh/<owner>/<repo>@<branch>/<path>` URLs)
+- `cdn.statically.io`
+
+`cdn.statically.io` was used as a fallback but was slow and sometimes timed
+out.
